      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Feunn...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600650075006E006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il refuse de se nourrir, et j’ai beau l’avoir amené\nau Centre Pokémon, personne ne sait ce qu’il a...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, je sais ! Il y a quelques années, il y avait\nune herboristerie à Illumis.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi on demande à l’ancien patron, il saura\npeut-être comment soigner Feunnec !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 163
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vais rester ici et prendre soin de ce pauvre\npetit. Pourrais-tu aller voir l’ancien herboriste ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Commence par aller au Lounge Café.\nIl raffole de cet endroit.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006D0065006E00630065002000700061007200200061006C006C006500720020006100750020004C006F0075006E00670065002000430061006600E9002E000A0049006C00200072006100660066006F006C0065002000640065002000630065007400200065006E00640072006F00690074002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rends-toi au Lounge Café. L’ancien patron de\nl’herboristerie raffole de cet endroit.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que tu veux ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D006300650020007100750065002000740075002000760065007500780020003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous vous y connaissez en remèdes ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200076006F007500730020007900200063006F006E006E00610069007300730065007A00200065006E002000720065006D00E80064006500730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je voudrais soigner un Pokémon malade.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200076006F00750064007200610069007300200073006F00690067006E0065007200200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006D0061006C006100640065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh... Un Feunnec qui n’a pas la forme ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002E002E002E00200055006E0020004600650075006E006E0065006300200071007500690020006E2019006100200070006100730020006C006100200066006F0072006D00650020003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est un Pokémon qui grignote des brindilles\npour se détendre ou se remettre d’aplomb.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce qui leur redonne le plus la pêche, c’est\nune branche qu’on appelle un Rameau de Vie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais ces rameaux ne poussent que dans ce qui\nest aujourd’hui devenu la zone sauvage nº 5...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu reconnaîtras le Rameau de Vie à son\nodeur sucrée.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais avec tous ces Pokémon qui rôdent,\nbon courage si tu comptes aller le chercher...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
